import
	keen/math/geom2d/size2

test
	area (2, 3) is 6

test
	shorter-side (2, 3) is 2

test
	(2, 3) * (4, 5) is 8, 15

test
	scale-factor (1, 1), (2, 3) is 2
	scale-factor (0, 0), (2, 3) is 1
	scale-factor (1, 0), (2, 3) is 2
	scale-factor (0, 1), (2, 3) is 3
	scale-factor (1, 0), (2, 0) is 2
	scale-factor (0, 0), (0, 0) is 1
